# Allowed scanner findings (regexes; see the docstring of scripts/scan_sensitive.py).
# Credit and download files (NOTICE, LICENSE, README.md, pyproject.toml) may name the
# project's author: name, GitHub username, email. Generic rules are allowed there by
# location only. The author's own terms are allowed per file through a private allow
# list (GETMEAJOB_ALLOW), so no personal term is written here. Code, tests, examples
# and other docs get no allowance at all.
^email:(NOTICE|pyproject\.toml):
^personal-url:(NOTICE|README\.md|pyproject\.toml):[^=]*=(https?://)?(www\.)?github\.com/
# Synthetic example accounts used in tests and docs.
^personal-url:[^=]*=(https?://)?(www\.)?github\.com/example-org/
